WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE
Translation of the Arabic narration (English captions are a translation, not the spoken language). At most two lines of 42 characters per cue.

1
00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.660
For an idea to become a factory…

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.460
it was once a line on a sheet of paper.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.740
And in Bahrain, from a small
woodworking workshop, our journey began.

4
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:18.920
Simple tools… many ideas… and an ambition
that grows with every piece we make.

5
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.120
And with every step, the dream grew.

6
00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.220
From a small workshop to
two integrated factories,

7
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:30.800
equipped with the latest European
machinery and technologies.

8
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:35.460
From our first project… to more
than fifty thousand projects,

9
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:41.720
through which our work reached the
Gulf countries, Iraq and Jordan.

10
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.720
We left our mark on prominent projects;

11
00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:48.943
among them Marassi
Al Bahrain, Durrat Al Bahrain,

12
00:00:48.983 --> 00:00:53.040
Water Bay, and many
government housing projects.

13
00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:56.460
Every project added to our experience…

14
00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:00.510
and every challenge
opened a new idea for us.

15
00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:03.340
Then came the coronavirus pandemic.

16
00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:08.600
Supply chains were disrupted, and getting
hold of materials became a challenge.

17
00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:11.000
And so we asked ourselves:

18
00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.040
What if we made it here… in Bahrain?

19
00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:17.660
From that question,
“Yas Factory” was born.

20
00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:22.780
The first of its kind in Bahrain for
producing and cladding wood panels.

21
00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:27.340
We turned the supply challenge
into an industrial capability;

22
00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:34.840
through it we control quality, develop our
products, and open new doors for export.

23
00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:39.160
And from Bahrain, our products
set out to the region.

24
00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:43.770
Distribution agreements
covering all the Gulf countries,

25
00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:46.300
in addition to Iraq and Jordan.

26
00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:50.680
And exclusive designs
and colours worldwide,

27
00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:56.420
giving designers and manufacturers
options that carry our signature.

28
00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:59.940
And our innovation
extended to the details.

29
00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:05.300
More than twenty-seven patents
for aluminium profiles,

30
00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.540
designed and developed by our team;

31
00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:13.940
solutions that began from a practical
need and became products of our own.

32
00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:17.400
And today… we open a new chapter.

33
00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:23.080
New deals and agreements,
partnerships that widen our presence,

34
00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:27.720
and opportunities that open
larger markets for our products.

35
00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:32.160
And behind this growth, a team
whose capabilities we invest in,

36
00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.580
processes whose efficiency we develop,

37
00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:38.516
and a digital system we
are working to connect

38
00:02:38.556 --> 00:02:42.920
with production, inventory,
sales and supply chains.

39
00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:45.140
The capability is there.

40
00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.160
The experience has accumulated.

41
00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:50.320
And we have more room to grow.

42
00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:54.300
And here begins the opportunity
to invest in our factory.

43
00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.180
To make use of our high
production capacity,

44
00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:03.380
develop new products, and take our
exports to the world's markets.

45
00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.351
And from here we look forward

46
00:03:05.391 --> 00:03:08.680
to a strategic partnership
that shares our vision,

47
00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:12.940
to contribute with us to turning these
opportunities into tangible results,

48
00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:19.020
with a clear plan and measurable goals.

49
00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:20.920
From an idea on paper…

50
00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:24.040
to an industry that goes beyond borders.

51
00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:27.480
We make today, and invest in tomorrow.

